# Implementation Plan: BugGraph Window Utility Tool (GUI Popup Workstation)

Transform BugGraph so that when `buggraph` (or `buggraph pop`) is entered, it launches a dedicated **Window Utility Tool** outside the terminal. The popup window will display the full BugGraph banner, connection status, and all interactive debugging tools in a rich, modern desktop utility interface.

